  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 167a01377efe36c498b078461c7127f6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Catherine
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DataCliente
  userID: 0
  displayName: catherine
  woodID: 0
  faceID: 0
  runeID: 0
  richiesta: "Oh my! Such a curious craft you bring to our modest town.. maybe I
    should try out what you offer. Oh, but I shouldn\u2019t.. No I can\u2019t keep
    going like this, see, my husband.. he is a little aloof one might say. I feel
    like our relationship has somehow faded over the years, no matter what I try!
    I think I... I would need something to rekindle what is seemingly lost.. Something
    to make his eyes twinkle like they used to when he looks at me. Something to
    remind him how precious I am to him. I wish for him to rejoice in my presence
    like the day we first met, and.. and the day we came home after our wedding...
    I miss being cherished like that... That is what I wish for\u2026 if something
    like that is possible that is\u2026"
  shortRequest: Catherine wishes for a mask to rekindle the fires of her relationship
    with her husband
  rispostaPositiva: "Mask maker! I was unsure it would work but... oh my it did!
    Wonderfully! I\u2019m ever so blessed and thankful, here\u2019s what I owe you
    for your expert services. "
  rispostaNeutra: "Uhm\u2026 mask maker? I think your creation is working but I still
    don\u2019t feel like it hits the right spot\u2026 could you fix it please?"
  rispostaNegativa: "Mask maker\u2026 Your work didn\u2019t give me what I hoped
    for and I\u2019m unsatisfied but alas I wish you to try again\u2026"
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84f0b44ef9a164a449b6c718f2af3fd2, type: 3}
